                "markdown": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI minimum elements: document author, data-format name + version, timestamp, generation tool, and signature; the primary AI system, its producer, and its data-flow/usage; runtime/framework infrastructure links; and AI-specific security controls / exploitability references where they can be expressed.\n\n**References**\n\n- [BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: System-Level / Data flow & usage](<https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements>)"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SBOM-BSIAI-MODEL-NAME",
              "name": "BsiSbomForAiModelName",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models: Model name"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models: Model name. References: BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Model name."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements",
              "help": {
                "text": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models minimum elements for each MachineLearningModel component: name, version, a unique identifier (PURL/CPE/SWHID/SWID), a model-weight hash using a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256+), a model card, the architecture, training datasets, limitations, and a license.\n\nWhere the fix goes:\n- CycloneDX: set components[].name.\n- SPDX 2.x: set packages[].name (PackageName), or files[].fileName for files.\n- SPDX 3.0: set name on the element.\n\nReferences:\n- BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Model name (https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements)",
                "markdown": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models minimum elements for each MachineLearningModel component: name, version, a unique identifier (PURL/CPE/SWHID/SWID), a model-weight hash using a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256+), a model card, the architecture, training datasets, limitations, and a license.\n\n**Where the fix goes**\n\n- **CycloneDX:** set components\\[\\].name.\n- **SPDX 2.x:** set packages\\[\\].name (PackageName), or files\\[\\].fileName for files.\n- **SPDX 3.0:** set name on the element.\n\n**References**\n\n- [BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Model name](<https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements>)"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SBOM-BSIAI-MODEL-VERSION",
              "name": "BsiSbomForAiModelVersion",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models: Model version"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models: Model version. References: BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Model version."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements",
              "help": {
                "text": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models minimum elements for each MachineLearningModel component: name, version, a unique identifier (PURL/CPE/SWHID/SWID), a model-weight hash using a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256+), a model card, the architecture, training datasets, limitations, and a license.\n\nWhere the fix goes:\n- CycloneDX: set components[].version.\n- SPDX 2.x: set packages[].versionInfo (PackageVersion).\n- SPDX 3.0: set software_packageVersion on the package.\n\nReferences:\n- BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Model version (https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements)",
                "markdown": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models minimum elements for each MachineLearningModel component: name, version, a unique identifier (PURL/CPE/SWHID/SWID), a model-weight hash using a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256+), a model card, the architecture, training datasets, limitations, and a license.\n\n**Where the fix goes**\n\n- **CycloneDX:** set components\\[\\].version.\n- **SPDX 2.x:** set packages\\[\\].versionInfo (PackageVersion).\n- **SPDX 3.0:** set software\\_packageVersion on the package.\n\n**References**\n\n- [BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Model version](<https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements>)"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SBOM-BSIAI-MODEL-IDENTIFIER",
              "name": "BsiSbomForAiModelIdentifier",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models: Unique model identifier (PURL, CPE, SWHID or SWID)"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models: Unique model identifier (PURL, CPE, SWHID or SWID). References: BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Model identifier."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements",
              "help": {
                "text": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models minimum elements for each MachineLearningModel component: name, version, a unique identifier (PURL/CPE/SWHID/SWID), a model-weight hash using a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256+), a model card, the architecture, training datasets, limitations, and a license.\n\nWhere the fix goes:\n- CycloneDX: set components[].purl (or cpe, or swhid[]).\n- SPDX 2.x: add a packages[].externalRefs[] entry with referenceCategory PACKAGE-MANAGER, referenceType purl and a pkg: locator (or a SECURITY cpe23Type, or a PERSISTENT-ID swh entry).\n- SPDX 3.0: set software_packageUrl, or add an externalIdentifier[] entry with externalIdentifierType packageUrl, cpe23, swhid or swid.\n\nReferences:\n- BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Model identifier (https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements)",
                "markdown": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models minimum elements for each MachineLearningModel component: name, version, a unique identifier (PURL/CPE/SWHID/SWID), a model-weight hash using a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256+), a model card, the architecture, training datasets, limitations, and a license.\n\n**Where the fix goes**\n\n- **CycloneDX:** set components\\[\\].purl (or cpe, or swhid\\[\\]).\n- **SPDX 2.x:** add a packages\\[\\].externalRefs\\[\\] entry with referenceCategory PACKAGE-MANAGER, referenceType purl and a pkg: locator (or a SECURITY cpe23Type, or a PERSISTENT-ID swh entry).\n- **SPDX 3.0:** set software\\_packageUrl, or add an externalIdentifier\\[\\] entry with externalIdentifierType packageUrl, cpe23, swhid or swid.\n\n**References**\n\n- [BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Model identifier](<https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements>)"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SBOM-BSIAI-MODEL-HASH",
              "name": "BsiSbomForAiModelHash",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models: Model-weight hash value"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models: Model-weight hash value. References: BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Model hash value."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements",
              "help": {
                "text": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models minimum elements for each MachineLearningModel component: name, version, a unique identifier (PURL/CPE/SWHID/SWID), a model-weight hash using a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256+), a model card, the architecture, training datasets, limitations, and a license.\n\nWhere the fix goes:\n- CycloneDX: add components[].hashes[] entries with alg SHA-256, SHA-384 or SHA-512 and the content.\n- SPDX 2.x: add packages[].checksums[] entries with algorithm SHA256, SHA384 or SHA512 and the checksumValue (PackageChecksum).\n- SPDX 3.0: add verifiedUsing[] Hash entries with algorithm sha256, sha384 or sha512 and the hashValue.\n\nReferences:\n- BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Model hash value (https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements)",
                "markdown": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models minimum elements for each MachineLearningModel component: name, version, a unique identifier (PURL/CPE/SWHID/SWID), a model-weight hash using a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256+), a model card, the architecture, training datasets, limitations, and a license.\n\n**Where the fix goes**\n\n- **CycloneDX:** add components\\[\\].hashes\\[\\] entries with alg SHA-256, SHA-384 or SHA-512 and the content.\n- **SPDX 2.x:** add packages\\[\\].checksums\\[\\] entries with algorithm SHA256, SHA384 or SHA512 and the checksumValue (PackageChecksum).\n- **SPDX 3.0:** add verifiedUsing\\[\\] Hash entries with algorithm sha256, sha384 or sha512 and the hashValue.\n\n**References**\n\n- [BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Model hash value](<https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements>)"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SBOM-BSIAI-MODEL-HASH-ALGO",
              "name": "BsiSbomForAiModelHashAlgorithm",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models: Model-weight hash uses a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256 or stronger)"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models: Model-weight hash uses a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256 or stronger). References: BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Hash algorithm."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements",
              "help": {
                "text": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models minimum elements for each MachineLearningModel component: name, version, a unique identifier (PURL/CPE/SWHID/SWID), a model-weight hash using a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256+), a model card, the architecture, training datasets, limitations, and a license.\n\nWhere the fix goes:\n- CycloneDX: add components[].hashes[] entries with alg SHA-256, SHA-384 or SHA-512 and the content.\n- SPDX 2.x: add packages[].checksums[] entries with algorithm SHA256, SHA384 or SHA512 and the checksumValue (PackageChecksum).\n- SPDX 3.0: add verifiedUsing[] Hash entries with algorithm sha256, sha384 or sha512 and the hashValue.\n\nReferences:\n- BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Hash algorithm (https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements)",
                "markdown": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models minimum elements for each MachineLearningModel component: name, version, a unique identifier (PURL/CPE/SWHID/SWID), a model-weight hash using a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256+), a model card, the architecture, training datasets, limitations, and a license.\n\n**Where the fix goes**\n\n- **CycloneDX:** add components\\[\\].hashes\\[\\] entries with alg SHA-256, SHA-384 or SHA-512 and the content.\n- **SPDX 2.x:** add packages\\[\\].checksums\\[\\] entries with algorithm SHA256, SHA384 or SHA512 and the checksumValue (PackageChecksum).\n- **SPDX 3.0:** add verifiedUsing\\[\\] Hash entries with algorithm sha256, sha384 or sha512 and the hashValue.\n\n**References**\n\n- [BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Hash algorithm](<https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements>)"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SBOM-BSIAI-MODEL-CARD",
              "name": "BsiSbomForAiModelCard",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models: Model card"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models: Model card. References: BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Model card."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements",
              "help": {
                "text": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models minimum elements for each MachineLearningModel component: name, version, a unique identifier (PURL/CPE/SWHID/SWID), a model-weight hash using a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256+), a model card, the architecture, training datasets, limitations, and a license.\n\nWhere the fix goes:\n- CycloneDX: add a components[].externalReferences[] entry of type model-card to the model component.\n- SPDX 2.x: no AI or dataset profile exists in this format; use CycloneDX 1.5+ or SPDX 3.0.\n- SPDX 3.0: add a documentation externalRef[] entry linking the model card to the ai_AIPackage.\n\nReferences:\n- BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Model card (https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements)",
                "markdown": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models minimum elements for each MachineLearningModel component: name, version, a unique identifier (PURL/CPE/SWHID/SWID), a model-weight hash using a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256+), a model card, the architecture, training datasets, limitations, and a license.\n\n**Where the fix goes**\n\n- **CycloneDX:** add a components\\[\\].externalReferences\\[\\] entry of type model-card to the model component.\n- **SPDX 2.x:** no AI or dataset profile exists in this format; use CycloneDX 1.5+ or SPDX 3.0.\n- **SPDX 3.0:** add a documentation externalRef\\[\\] entry linking the model card to the ai\\_AIPackage.\n\n**References**\n\n- [BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Model card](<https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements>)"
              }
            },
            {
