              "helpUri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements",
              "help": {
                "text": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models minimum elements for each MachineLearningModel component: name, version, a unique identifier (PURL/CPE/SWHID/SWID), a model-weight hash using a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256+), a model card, the architecture, training datasets, limitations, and a license.\n\nWhere the fix goes:\n- CycloneDX: list modelCard.modelParameters.datasets[] entries with a ref to each data component, or nest the data components (with their data[] block) under the model.\n- SPDX 2.x: no AI or dataset profile exists in this format; use CycloneDX 1.5+ or SPDX 3.0.\n- SPDX 3.0: add a trainedOn (or contains) Relationship from the ai_AIPackage to each dataset_DatasetPackage.\n\nReferences:\n- BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Training datasets (https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements)",
                "markdown": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models minimum elements for each MachineLearningModel component: name, version, a unique identifier (PURL/CPE/SWHID/SWID), a model-weight hash using a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256+), a model card, the architecture, training datasets, limitations, and a license.\n\n**Where the fix goes**\n\n- **CycloneDX:** list modelCard.modelParameters.datasets\\[\\] entries with a ref to each data component, or nest the data components (with their data\\[\\] block) under the model.\n- **SPDX 2.x:** no AI or dataset profile exists in this format; use CycloneDX 1.5+ or SPDX 3.0.\n- **SPDX 3.0:** add a trainedOn (or contains) Relationship from the ai\\_AIPackage to each dataset\\_DatasetPackage.\n\n**References**\n\n- [BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Training datasets](<https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements>)"
              }
