              "helpUri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements",
              "help": {
                "text": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models minimum elements for each MachineLearningModel component: name, version, a unique identifier (PURL/CPE/SWHID/SWID), a model-weight hash using a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256+), a model card, the architecture, training datasets, limitations, and a license.\n\nWhere the fix goes:\n- CycloneDX: add components[].licenses[] entries (license.id with an SPDX identifier, or an expression).\n- SPDX 2.x: set packages[].licenseDeclared (PackageLicenseDeclared) or packages[].licenseConcluded; NOASSERTION and NONE are read as absent.\n- SPDX 3.0: add a hasDeclaredLicense (or hasConcludedLicense) Relationship from the package to a simplelicensing_LicenseExpression element.\n\nReferences:\n- BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Model license (https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements)",
                "markdown": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Models minimum elements for each MachineLearningModel component: name, version, a unique identifier (PURL/CPE/SWHID/SWID), a model-weight hash using a NIST-approved algorithm (SHA-256+), a model card, the architecture, training datasets, limitations, and a license.\n\n**Where the fix goes**\n\n- **CycloneDX:** add components\\[\\].licenses\\[\\] entries (license.id with an SPDX identifier, or an expression).\n- **SPDX 2.x:** set packages\\[\\].licenseDeclared (PackageLicenseDeclared) or packages\\[\\].licenseConcluded; NOASSERTION and NONE are read as absent.\n- **SPDX 3.0:** add a hasDeclaredLicense (or hasConcludedLicense) Relationship from the package to a simplelicensing\\_LicenseExpression element.\n\n**References**\n\n- [BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Models / Model license](<https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements>)"
              }
            },
