                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Security: Exploitability reference"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Security: Exploitability reference. References: BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Security / Exploitability reference."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements",
              "help": {
                "text": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI minimum elements: document author, data-format name + version, timestamp, generation tool, and signature; the primary AI system, its producer, and its data-flow/usage; runtime/framework infrastructure links; and AI-specific security controls / exploitability references where they can be expressed.\n\nReferences:\n- BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Security / Exploitability reference (https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements)",
                "markdown": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI minimum elements: document author, data-format name + version, timestamp, generation tool, and signature; the primary AI system, its producer, and its data-flow/usage; runtime/framework infrastructure links; and AI-specific security controls / exploitability references where they can be expressed.\n\n**References**\n\n- [BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Security / Exploitability reference](<https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements>)"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SBOM-BSIAI-UNTYPED-ML",
              "name": "BsiSbomForAiUntypedMlContent",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI readiness: ML content detected but not typed machine-learning-model"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI readiness: ML content detected but not typed machine-learning-model. References: BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Applicability."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements",
              "help": {
                "text": "Components with pkg:huggingface PURLs or model-card references look like ML models; leaving them untyped hides them from every AI-BOM readiness check. Type them as machine-learning models and attach the AI metadata.\n\nWhere the fix goes:\n- CycloneDX: set components[].type to machine-learning-model and add a modelCard.\n- SPDX 2.x: no AI or dataset profile exists in this format; use CycloneDX 1.5+ or SPDX 3.0.\n- SPDX 3.0: make the element an ai_AIPackage (or set software_primaryPurpose to model).\n\nReferences:\n- BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Applicability (https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements)",
                "markdown": "Components with pkg:huggingface PURLs or model-card references look like ML models; leaving them untyped hides them from every AI-BOM readiness check. Type them as machine-learning models and attach the AI metadata.\n\n**Where the fix goes**\n\n- **CycloneDX:** set components\\[\\].type to machine-learning-model and add a modelCard.\n- **SPDX 2.x:** no AI or dataset profile exists in this format; use CycloneDX 1.5+ or SPDX 3.0.\n- **SPDX 3.0:** make the element an ai\\_AIPackage (or set software\\_primaryPurpose to model).\n\n**References**\n\n- [BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Applicability](<https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements>)"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
